# Edge 3 runs from (4,0,3) to (1,0,3); edge 0 runs from (0,0,0) to (6,0,0).
# Their projections are collinear along y=0 and overlap in the interval [1,4].
note = two non-adjacent edges whose projections share a segment
knot = unknot
collinear_overlap    == 1
vertex_on_edge       >= 2
spatial              == 0
